API"},"86":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#接下来","content":"接下来"},"87":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","content":"这里使用 React，因为它可以在一个例子中同时展示状态创建与渲染追踪。底层 store 模型在所有框架中相同。"},"88":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#1-创建-store","content":"访问器 getter 会被缓存。Coaction 记录它读取的状态字段，仅在其中某项依赖变化后重新计算。"},"89":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#1-创建-store","content":"`set()` 打开不可变更新边界。回调内部编辑 Mutative draft，subscriber 接收提交后的新状态。"},"90":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#2-用-observer-追踪渲染时读取的字段","content":"在这个示例中，`observer()` 会记录组件渲染时通过 `useCounter()` 读取的字段，例如 `count` 和 `doubled`。仅更新无关字段时，这次状态更新不会触发该组件重新渲染。"},"91":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#2-用-observer-追踪渲染时读取的字段","content":"不使用 `observer()` 时，`useCounter()` 订阅整个 store。对小型 store 或确实需要观察全部状态的组件，这一行为很实用。"},"92":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#3-在更清晰时使用显式-selector","content":"自动追踪并非强制："},"93":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#3-在更清晰时使用显式-selector","content":"选择器执行时，Coaction 会记录它读取的依赖。依赖未变化时直接复用已有结果。依赖失效后重新执行选择器，并用 `Object.is` 比较结果，决定本次更新是否触发组件渲染。"},"94":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#3-在更清晰时使用显式-selector","content":"多个组件使用同一个字段选择器时，可以复用 `useCounter.auto()` 返回的选择器映射。"},"95":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#4-在-react-外使用-imperative-api","content":"框架 store 仍保留 core store contract："},"96":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#4-在-react-外使用-imperative-api","content":"`getState()` 包含数据、方法与 getter；`getPureState()` 只返回数据，更适合日志、序列化与测试。"},"97":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#接下来","content":"<Card title=\"状态与 action\" href=\"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions\" description=\"理解写入、schema、订阅与生命周期。\" />"},"98":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#接下来","content":"<Card title=\"计算状态\" href=\"/zh/docs/concepts/computed\" description=\"在访问器 getter 与显式依赖间做选择。\" />"},"99":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#接下来","content":"<Card title=\"Slices\" href=\"/zh/docs/concepts/slices\" description=\"将大型原生 store 组织为多个 namespace。\" />"},"100":{"id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/getting-started/quick-start#接下来","content":"<Card title=\"共享运行时\" href=\"/zh/docs/shared/overview\" description=\"将方法执行迁移到 Worker 权威端。\" />"},"101":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","type":"page","content":"计算状态","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","核心概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed"},"102":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","content":"选择冻结 getter 快照、显式路径或可管理生命周期的深层派生 selector。"},"103":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#访问器-getter","content":"访问器 getter"},"104":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#使用-get-声明显式依赖","content":"使用 `get()` 声明显式依赖"},"105":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#追踪粒度","content":"追踪粒度"},"106":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#可管理生命周期的派生读取","content":"可管理生命周期的派生读取"},"107":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#对象身份是独立依赖","content":"对象身份是独立依赖"},"108":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#结果比较","content":"结果比较"},"109":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#事务归属与-react","content":"事务、归属与 React"},"110":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#独立信号原语","content":"独立信号原语"},"111":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#外部适配器","content":"外部适配器"},"112":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#性能预期","content":"性能预期"},"113":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","content":"Coaction 的 computed value 与字段追踪共用同一张 signal graph。组件可以读取缓存 getter，getter 再读取 store 字段，失效过程沿依赖图传播，无需手工维护 memo 数组。"},"114":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#访问器-getter","content":"普通 getter 是默认的派生状态方式："},"115":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#访问器-getter","content":"`subtotal` 在 `items` 变化前保持缓存；`total` 依赖缓存后的 `subtotal` 与 `taxRate`，关系会自动发现。"},"116":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#访问器-getter","content":"Getter 应保持纯函数，不应调用 `setState()`、修改外部状态，或依赖隐藏副作用产生不同结果。"},"117":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#使用-get-声明显式依赖","content":"store factory 的第二个参数可手工声明依赖："},"118":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#使用-get-声明显式依赖","content":"当显式声明让跨 slice 逻辑更清楚，或集成代码不应依赖隐式 getter read 时，使用这种形式。"},"119":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#使用-get-声明显式依赖","content":"无参数调用 `get()` 会返回当前根状态。在 slice factory 中，它适合读取另一 namespace，但更新仍必须通过 `set()`。"},"120":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#追踪粒度","content":"原生 getter 和 `get(deps, fn)` 在冻结快照上读取状态，以 store 或 slice 的字段为依赖边界。例如，读取 `this.user.name` 的 getter 会因 `user.age` 的变化而重新求值。显式声明 `get(s => [s.user.name], fn)` 时，依赖选择器仍会重新执行，但只要 `name` 不变，就能复用 `fn` 的结果。即使发生了重新求值，只要返回的基本类型值相同，下游消费者也可以复用原结果。"},"121":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#追踪粒度","content":"React selector 与 `observer` 使用可回收的深层路径追踪。读取 `state.user.name` 的 selector 可以忽略仅改变 age 的 recipe。父对象 replacement、数组结构变化和 graph snapshot patches 可能扩大失效范围。数组元素按值读取：读取 `state.todos[0].title` 的 reader 依赖 `todos[0]` 本身，因此该元素内部的任何写入都会让 `observer` 重新渲染；selector 会重跑，但只有结果变化时才重新渲染。"},"122":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#可管理生命周期的派生读取","content":"可选入口 `coaction/derived` 提供归属 store 的缓存读取，不改变原生 getter 默认行为，也不会把这套运行时代码加入默认入口的 consumer bundle："},"123":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#可管理生命周期的派生读取","content":"`derivePath` 创建时复制路径，支持 string/number/symbol key；数据不存在时返回 `undefined`。它只选择 state data，不选择 action 或原生 computed getter。动态路径和 getter 组合请使用 `derive`。这两个 API 都不会把任意 `reduce`、`filter` 或 `sort` 自动变成增量算法。"},"124":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#对象身份是独立依赖","content":"`derive(store, selector)` 默认保留所有经过的对象身份依赖。`{ deep: true }` 显式选择值语义：为了读取子属性而经过父对象，不会自动保留父对象身份。JavaScript 的 `===`、`Object.is` 和 WeakMap 查询无法通过 property trap 识别，需要显式标记："},"125":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#对象身份是独立依赖","content":"age 变化会替换 user 对象，因此这里即使 name 不变也必须重算。`identity()` 返回原本的 readonly 对象；`whole()` 则为整体扫描返回自有 raw data，不能修改它。"},"126":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#对象身份是独立依赖","content":"数组元素是值，而不是 readonly 代理。通过下标读取、经扫描找到或由 getter 返回的元素，都是同一个被冻结的元素本身，无论从哪条路径得到都相等；同时存放在对象键上的对象，在两处也是同一个身份。读取元素即依赖它的身份：元素内部的任何写入都会使它获得新身份，而对同级元素的写入不会。在 `set()` 之外写入元素时，严格模式代码会抛出 `TypeError`，非严格模式脚本则静默忽略这次写入；两种情况下 state 都不会改变。"},"127":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#对象身份是独立依赖","content":"`filter`、`map`、`find`、`reduce`、`slice` 等只读数组操作以及 `for...of` 迭代都按整个数组登记一个依赖。即使 `find` 提前返回，依赖范围也覆盖整个数组。回调中读取的其他状态仍会单独追踪。需要按整体追踪索引循环或对象属性遍历时，可使用 `whole()`。"},"128":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#对象身份是独立依赖","content":"直接返回 state 对象，或将它放进普通对象／数组的数据属性中，会自动保留 terminal dependency；带 cycle 的结果包装也受支持。追踪不会执行结果的 accessor，也不会遍历 opaque instance、函数或 closure；在这些位置携带 state 时，应在 selector 内用 `identity()` 标记。数组、空洞、symbol、null prototype、cycle 和共享引用保留现有 local-state contract。Date、Map、Set 和 class instance 仍是 atomic identity leaf，其内部 mutation 不会自动变得可观察。"},"129":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#结果比较","content":"默认使用 `Object.is`，包括 NaN 与正负零的区别。新对象即使字段相同，也属于不同结果；可以用 `equals` 显式复用等价派生数据："},"130":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#结果比较","content":"结果比较与依赖收集独立；比较函数应保持纯函数，其读取不会添加响应式依赖。即使复用结果，分支依赖也会重新协调。结果携带的 state 对象发生变化时仍会通知，包括身份稳定的 root/slice facade，避免 `equals` 隐藏实际 state 变化。默认不对任意 local graph 做结构深比较。"},"131":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#事务归属与-react","content":"recipe 内的读取使用当前 store 的 draft，不更新已提交缓存，也不保留 draft proxy。recipe 抛错或 validator 拒绝后，已提交缓存保持有效；消费者在 commit 被接受后失效。selector 抛错后，缓存读取仍抛错，输入依赖变化后重新求值。可组合归属同一 store 的派生读取；这个 API 不负责跨 store 的事务协调。selector 必须是同步纯读取；`await` 后的工作不在追踪范围内，这不是 Resource/Suspense API。"},"132":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#事务归属与-react","content":"每个读取保留当前依赖，直到调用 `dispose()` 或 `store.destroy()`。尚未读取的派生对象不会开启 patches。`dispose()` 可重复调用，会释放该读取的依赖与缓存，之后再次读取会抛错。停止某个消费者不会销毁 store 归属的派生对象，其他消费者仍可继续使用；原生 getter 的缓存仍采用其既有 store 生命周期。"},"133":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#事务归属与-react","content":"请随 store 或另一个明确 owner 创建派生对象，不要在 React render 中创建，也不要把 `useMemo` 当成清理边界，否则废弃的 render 可能留下实例。已存在的 store 归属读取可以用于 selector 或 observer："},"134":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#事务归属与-react","content":"这里 `usePerson` 来自 `@coaction/react`。owner 结束时销毁 `displayName`，或销毁其 store；组件卸载会释放 React 订阅。SSR 的 store 和派生读取归属对应请求；shared client 使用已接受的镜像状态重新计算。派生定义和缓存不会进入 patches、history 或 transport payload。"},"135":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#独立信号原语","content":"`coaction` 导出的 `computed`、`signal` 和 `effect` 是 alien-signals 原语，可用于构建独立的信号依赖图。它们没有随 store 管理的销毁机制或草稿读取缓存。独立的 `computed` 会保留对象依赖。若返回整个根状态视图，需通过 `whole(store.getState())` 显式登记整体依赖。"},"136":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#独立信号原语","content":"这些原语记录的 store 路径依赖会保留到 store 销毁。需要主动释放动态依赖时，可用 `derive` 创建派生读取，并在使用结束时调用 `dispose()`。初始化数据中嵌套对象上的普通 getter 会被求值为数据，不会被递归注册为计算属性。"},"137":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#外部适配器","content":"原生 getter computed 属于 Coaction 自有状态。外部 adapter instance 不会自动获得 Coaction 缓存 getter 或 `get(deps, selector)` 语义；应由其自身运行时（MobX computed、Pinia getter、selector 或 machine state）负责派生状态。`derive` 和 `derivePath` 会明确拒绝外部 adapter。"},"138":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#性能预期","content":"依赖未变化时，多次读取 getter 会直接返回缓存结果。状态更新后，运行时还须维护公开状态的只读视图，并在下一次求值前刷新计算使用的快照。请分别测量缓存命中和更新后首次读取的成本。复现命令见性能指南。"},"139":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#性能预期","content":"深层追踪适合稀疏读取。全量集合扫描继续使用读取冻结快照的原生 getter，也可以用 `derive(store, s => s.total)` 组合该 getter。若通过深层 proxy 遍历每个元素，只会增加追踪成本，不能省去求值。不可变更新仍需复制变化路径上的容器，flat array 的单点写入并不独立于数组长度。"},"140":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#性能预期","content":"`pnpm benchmark:derived` 覆盖 1k/10k/50k 稀疏读取、10k 全量扫描、稳定缓存读取，以及尚未读取／已销毁派生对象的写入成本；已加入 `benchmark:check`。"},"141":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","type":"page","content":"Slices","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","核心概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices"},"142":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","content":"使用具名工厂定义原生 store 的状态分区，读取分区字段并执行跨分区更新。"},"143":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#选择-slice-字段","content":"选择 slice 字段"},"144":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#为歧义对象声明模式","content":"为歧义对象声明模式"},"145":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#边界","content":"边界"},"146":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","content":"每个 slice 工厂定义一个具名状态分区。例如，名为 `counter` 的 slice 在根状态中对应 `state.counter`，其中的计数可通过 `state.counter.count` 读取。"},"147":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","content":"在 `set(() => ...)` 内，`this` 指向当前 slice；显式 `draft` 参数始终代表根 store，适合跨 slice 更新。"},"148":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#选择-slice-字段","content":"在 React 中，`observer()` 会追踪 render 期间读取的 slice 字段："},"149":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#选择-slice-字段","content":"也可以使用显式 selector："},"150":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#为歧义对象声明模式","content":"`sliceMode` 有三个值："},"151":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#为歧义对象声明模式","content":"`'single'`：把输入当作单一状态对象；"},"152":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#为歧义对象声明模式","content":"`'slices'`：要求输入是 slice factory map；"},"153":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#为歧义对象声明模式","content":"`'auto'`：根据输入 shape 推断（兼容默认值）。"},"154":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#为歧义对象声明模式","content":"所有 enumerable value 都是 function 的对象存在歧义：它既可能是只有方法的单 store，也可能是 slice factory map。开发构建会在 `auto` 遇到这种 shape 时警告。请显式表达意图："},"155":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#边界","content":"slice key 与每个 slice 的根字段在初始化后固定。"},"156":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#边界","content":"从 `getState().counter` 解构的方法仍绑定到该 slice。"},"157":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#边界","content":"原生 slices 支持 local、shared-main 与 shared-client 模式。"},"158":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#边界","content":"外部状态适配器仅支持 whole store，不能作为 slice 嵌套。"},"159":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#边界","content":"只有当 namespace 能澄清所有权时才使用 slices；小型 store 不必仅为模仿目录结构而拆分。"},"160":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"page","content":"状态与 action","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","核心概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions"},"161":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","content":"理解 Coaction 的不可变更新边界、固定 public schema、方法绑定、订阅与生命周期。"},"162":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#set-外的状态不可变","content":"`set()` 外的状态不可变"},"163":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#根-schema-固定","content":"根 schema 固定"},"164":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#action-保持绑定","content":"Action 保持绑定"},"165":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#读取检查与订阅","content":"读取、检查与订阅"},"166":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#本地-patch-按需开启","content":"本地 patch 按需开启"},"167":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#所有权结束时销毁-store","content":"所有权结束时销毁 store"},"168":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#set-外的状态不可变","content":"Coaction 暴露只读 public state。action 可以通过 `this` 读取，但所有 Coaction 自有状态写入必须发生在 `set()` 内："},"169":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#set-外的状态不可变","content":"也可以显式使用根 draft："},"170":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#set-外的状态不可变","content":"传入部分状态对象会合并已知字段，传入 `null` 则不修改状态。应用通常通过具名 action 更新状态。集成代码和测试也可以直接调用 `store.setState()`。"},"171":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#根-schema-固定","content":"Coaction 在初始化期间记录 public shape。单 store 之后不能添加未知顶层 key；slices store 不能增加新 slice，也不能向已有 slice 添加新顶层字段。"},"172":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#根-schema-固定","content":"请为动态数据预先声明容器："},"173":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#根-schema-固定","content":"replacement API 可以在单 store 中省略已知根字段，public getter 仍保留并读作 `undefined`。slice 根 key 更严格：slice 不能消失，也不能被非对象值替换。"},"174":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#action-保持绑定","content":"从 `getState()` 获取的方法在调用时会重新绑定到最新 public state："},"175":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#action-保持绑定","content":"因此 `this` action 可以安全传给事件处理器或被解构。需要 `this` 的 action 不应写成 arrow function，因为箭头函数捕获 lexical `this`。"},"176":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#读取检查与订阅","content":"状态提交后 subscriber 才会收到通知。各框架包在同一 contract 上构建自己的 reactive primitive。"},"177":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#本地-patch-按需开启","content":"本地 store 默认使用最短更新路径。只有集成需要 patch pair 时才设置 `enablePatches: true`："},"178":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#本地-patch-按需开启","content":"共享 store 会启用 patch 行为，因为增量同步依赖它。包含 `__proto__`、`prototype` 或 `constructor` 的不安全 patch path 会被原子性拒绝。"},"179":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#所有权结束时销毁-store","content":"`destroy()` 清除订阅、运行已注册的集成 cleanup，并释放 transport。销毁后的操作会被拒绝。组件通常由框架 wrapper 管理订阅清理，但动态创建的 store、Yjs binding 和自定义 transport 仍需明确的所有权方案。"},"180":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/store-modes","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/store-modes","type":"page","content":"Store 模式与入口","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","核心概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/store-modes"},"181":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/store-modes-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/store-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/store-modes","content":"理解本地 store、共享权威端、client mirror 与 Coaction 的隔离包边界。"},"182":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/store-modes-1","page_id":"/zh/doc