@coaction/xstate`"},"276":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#支持矩阵","content":"支持"},"277":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#支持矩阵","content":"不支持"},"278":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#支持矩阵","content":"N/A"},"279":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#支持矩阵","content":"表中的共享支持指客户端可远程调用由 Coaction 暴露的方法。绕过 Coaction 直接写入第三方 store 时，写入是否生效、是否传播到其他上下文，取决于对应的适配器。"},"280":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#zustand-示例","content":"当 Zustand store 本身必须保持 public API，或其他模块仍直接消费它时使用此路径。Coaction 拥有的新 store 应优先采用原生状态模型。"},"281":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#mobx-示例","content":"外部 runtime 拥有其 mutable object。直接写到可变 adapter 的未知根属性不会被提升到 Coaction 固定的 raw/public schema。"},"282":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#piniajotaireduxvaltio-与-xstate","content":"这些包暴露 `bind*` helper，并在需要时提供 `adapt()` wrapper："},"283":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#piniajotaireduxvaltio-与-xstate","content":"XState 会阻止 `setState()`，应发送 actor event。Redux 与 XState 当前只维护本地 contract。"},"284":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#编写-adapter","content":"自定义 adapter 从 `coaction/adapter` 导入 `defineExternalStoreAdapter()`。它必须保留 core `Store` 生命周期，在直接外部不可变写入后通知 Coaction，并通过 contract test 声明支持边界。开始前请阅读贡献指南。"},"285":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#写入边界","content":"Coaction 管理 `store.apply()` 的提交过程，包括生成正向和逆向补丁、运行提交前校验和发布状态提交。需要向外部运行时写入时，适配器通过 `internal.externalApply` 提供写入函数。"},"286":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#写入边界","content":"若适配器只允许通过外部运行时自身的 API 更新状态，可在 `internal.assertMutationAllowed` 中抛错以拒绝直接写入，无需提供 `internal.externalApply`。"},"287":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#写入边界","content":"保留 Coaction 提供的 `store.apply()`，以便先于适配器运行的中间件仍能观察到这次写入。"},"288":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"page","content":"框架集成","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks"},"289":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","content":"将同一套 Coaction store 模型连接到 React、Vue、Angular、Svelte 或 Solid。"},"290":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#react","content":"React"},"291":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#whole-selector","content":"Whole selector"},"292":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#服务端渲染","content":"服务端渲染"},"293":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#vue","content":"Vue"},"294":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#angular","content":"Angular"},"295":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#svelte","content":"Svelte"},"296":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#solid","content":"Solid"},"297":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#共享模式说明","content":"共享模式说明"},"298":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","content":"框架包使用各自生态原生的 reactive primitive 包装 core `Store` contract。状态创建、action、computed getter、slices 与共享模式规则仍由 core 提供。"},"299":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#react","content":"`@coaction/react` 支持 React 18 和 19。CI 分别安装这两个主版本，运行 React 绑定测试、类型检查和浏览器水合测试。"},"300":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#react","content":"在 `observer()` 内，无 selector 的 hook 调用会追踪 render 期间读取的字段；在其外部则订阅整个 store。意图更清楚时可以显式选择："},"301":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#react","content":"`<Observer>` 可创建更小的追踪区域，`useCounter.auto()` 返回缓存字段 selector map。"},"302":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#whole-selector","content":"如果 selector 本来就要扫描大部分 state，逐个追踪读取几乎没有收益。传入 `{ whole: true }`，让它直接在 store 的纯数据上运行："},"303":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#whole-selector","content":"whole selector 接收的是 `getPureState()`：store 自有的纯对象数据，不含 getter 和方法。它不登记任何依赖，每次提交都会重新运行；只有结果按 `Object.is`（或你传入的 `equals`）判断发生变化时，组件才重新渲染。当没有 tracked selector 或 `observer()` 读取某个 store 时，它的写入会跳过追踪所需的 patch 记账。"},"304":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#whole-selector","content":"whole 选择器直接读取 store 持有的原始数据，调用方须按只读数据使用。每个 hook 调用应始终使用同一种订阅模式，在 `{ whole: true }` 与路径追踪之间切换会改变内部 hook 的调用顺序。"},"305":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#服务端渲染","content":"服务端渲染期间，React 绑定读取 store 的当前快照。组件可使用 `observer()`、传入选择器，或直接调用不带选择器的 hook。因此这三种方式都能读取渲染前已写入的值。"},"306":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#服务端渲染","content":"例如，请求预加载和状态恢复都可能在渲染前写入 store。客户端首次渲染时应使用与服务端相同的状态数据，以免这部分内容出现水合不匹配。"},"307":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#服务端渲染","content":"需要读取 store 创建时的初始值，可显式调用 `getInitialState()`："},"308":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#vue","content":"`useCounter({ autoSelector: true })` 为已知字段返回 computed ref。方法可直接调用，数据 ref 通过 `.value` 读取。"},"309":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#angular","content":"`select()` 为 selector 结果返回 Angular signal-like accessor。"},"310":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#svelte","content":"Selector 调用返回 readable Svelte store。"},"311":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#solid","content":"Selector 结果是 Solid accessor。"},"312":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#共享模式说明","content":"共享模式下，客户端直接从本地镜像读取数据。通过镜像调用的方法会在主存储端执行，并向客户端返回 Promise。需要方法的结果或需要读取更新后的镜像时，应先 `await` 该调用。"},"313":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#共享模式说明","content":"生成的 selector map 基于初始化期间已知的 schema。声明 record 内的动态 path 应使用显式 selector，不要期待 auto-selector map 自动增长。"},"314":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","type":"page","content":"Logger、persist 与 history","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware"},"315":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","content":"通过 middleware 为 Coaction 自有 store 添加诊断、持久化与 undo/redo。"},"316":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#logger","content":"Logger"},"317":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#persist","content":"Persist"},"318":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#history","content":"History"},"319":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"共享模式放置规则"},"320":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","content":"Middleware 在创建期间接收 store，可以装饰方法或附加 API。请通过复数 `middlewares` option 按数组顺序传入。"},"321":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#logger","content":"你可以注入兼容 console 的 logger。Serialized mode 能安全处理循环诊断值与 BigInt；日志不会削弱共享 JSON contract。"},"322":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#logger","content":"共享模式下，主存储端持有可写状态并执行 action。要记录实际执行的 action 和补丁，应在主存储端安装 logger。客户端的 logger 只记录代理调用和镜像更新。"},"323":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#persist","content":"默认 storage 是可用时的 `localStorage`。`createJSONStorage()` 可适配其他 Web Storage instance，自定义 `PersistStorage` 可同步也可异步。"},"324":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#persist","content":"`persist()` 会附加："},"325":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#persist","content":"如果 payload 显式包含与当前配置不同的 version，请提供 `migrate`；否则 hydration 会跳过，`onRehydrateStorage` 会收到 error。"},"326":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#persist","content":"`merge` 结果仍必须遵守固定 schema，未知根 key 会被拒绝。"},"327":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#history","content":"`partialize` 限定参与 time travel 的状态，`limit` 必须是非负整数。"},"328":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"Middleware"},"329":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"Local"},"330":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"Shared main"},"331":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"Shared client"},"332":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"Logger"},"333":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"支持"},"334":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"支持"},"335":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"可见性有限"},"336":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],