on","集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync"},"347":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","content":"通过待发送队列保存本地变更，拉取远端更新后重放待发送变更，支持离线写入与恢复投递。"},"348":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#查看队列","content":"查看队列"},"349":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"后端"},"350":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#冲突","content":"冲突"},"351":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#状态必须是-json","content":"状态必须是 JSON"},"352":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#存储","content":"存储"},"353":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#投递语义","content":"投递语义"},"354":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","content":"`@coaction/sync` 是远程同步中间件，可与现有 action、选择器、`observer()` 和历史记录配合使用。带有变更补丁的本地提交会加入待发送队列。应用远端更新本身不会产生回传记录，空补丁提交也会跳过。"},"355":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","content":"写入立即在本地生效。启用持久化时，中间件先将变更保存到待发送队列，再向服务端投递。队列写入成功后，即使进程在投递前退出，重启时仍可恢复这些变更。拉取远端更新后，中间件按冲突策略在新的远端状态上重放待发送的变更。"},"356":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","content":"这不是共享权威。同步的 store 自己拥有状态并与远端\n收敛；共享 store 的镜像是另一个 JavaScript 上下文中同一个权威端的视图。两者可以组合，\n互不蕴含。"},"357":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#查看队列","content":"`getPending()` 返回尚未获服务端确认的本地变更副本。修改返回的数组或其中的补丁不会改变内部队列，也不会影响后续重放。"},"358":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"引入"},"359":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"后端"},"360":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`@coaction/sync`"},"361":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`createFetchSyncAdapter` —— HTTP 上的 JSON"},"362":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`@coaction/sync/crud`"},"363":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`createCrudSyncAdapter` —— 面向记录的 API"},"364":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`@coaction/sync/supabase`"},"365":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"Postgres 表，可选 changes-since cursor 与 realtime"},"366":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`@coaction/sync/firestore`"},"367":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"Firestore collection 或 query，可选 `onSnapshot`"},"368":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`@coaction/sync/query`"},"369":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"TanStack Query"},"370":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"自定义同步适配器必须实现 `pull` 和 `push`。需要订阅远端更新时，可实现 `subscribe`。需要保存和恢复适配器状态时，可实现 `serialize` 和 `hydrate`。最小配置如下。"},"371":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"服务端只接受了部分变更时，`push` 须在 `ack` 中列出已持久保存的变更 ID。未获确认的变更保留在队列中等待重试。省略 `ack` 表示本批提交的变更已全部获确认。"},"372":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#冲突","content":"当一次 pull 带来的改动与仍在排队的写入重叠时，默认保留本地写入。\n`conflict: 'remote-wins'` 保留远端的；传函数则逐条 mutation 决定："},"373":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#冲突","content":"冲突处理函数每次接收独立的变更与补丁副本。修改这些副本不会改变待重放的队列，也不会影响下一次调用的输入。"},"374":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#状态必须是-json","content":"待发送队列、乐观更新后的快照和适配器记录的远端状态都使用 JSON。普通 JSON 序列化会把 `Date` 转成字符串，把 `Map` 转成空对象。同步中间件在提交前拒绝引入这些值的写入，调用方会收到错误，原状态保持不变。"},"375":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#状态必须是-json","content":"在写入前显式转换数据，例如将日期表示为 ISO 字符串或时间戳，将键值集合表示为普通对象，将集合表示为数组。"},"376":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#状态必须是-json","content":"`sync()` 不能挂在外部 mutable adapter 上 —— MobX、Valtio 与 Pinia 暴露的是\naccessor-backed state，这个契约在 store 构建时就会拒绝它。"},"377":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#存储","content":"默认使用 `localStorage`。可以传入 `storage`，或用 `@coaction/sync/indexeddb`\n获得更大的持久存储："},"378":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#存储","content":"默认配置需要可用的 `localStorage` 或自定义存储。两者均不可用时，初始化会报错。显式设置 `storage: false` 可使用内存队列，进程退出后尚未发送的变更会丢失。"},"379":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#投递语义","content":"mutation 是**至少一次**投递。远端提交一次写入、到确认抵达持久存储之间的窗口无法从客户端\n关闭，所以在这个窗口内崩溃意味着重启后会再发一次。请把 mutation 的 `id` 当作幂等键处理。"},"380":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#投递语义","content":"包 README\n涵盖持久 checkpoint 格式、各内置 adapter 在重放下的保证，以及 CRUD baseline。"},"381":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","type":"page","content":"Yjs 协作","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs"},"382":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","content":"将 Coaction 自有 pure state 绑定到 Y.Doc，并由 Yjs provider 负责 peer transport。"},"383":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#middleware-设置","content":"Middleware 设置"},"384":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#使用已有-ydoc","content":"使用已有 Y.Doc"},"385":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#存储与同步模型","content":"存储与同步模型"},"386":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#冲突语义","content":"冲突语义"},"387":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#要求与限制","content":"要求与限制"},"388":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","content":"`@coaction/yjs` 在 Coaction store pure data 与 Yjs 之间同步。它不提供网络连接；peer transport 应选择 `y-websocket`、`y-webrtc` 或其他 Yjs provider。"},"389":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#middleware-设置","content":"中间件创建 `Y.Doc` 并将其绑定到 store。调用 `store.destroy()` 时，会执行已注册的清理函数，解除这项绑定。"},"390":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#使用已有-ydoc","content":"`bindYjs()` 返回 `doc`、根 `map`、`syncNow()` 与 `destroy()`。"},"391":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#存储与同步模型","content":"状态位于 `doc.getMap(key).get('state')`；"},"392":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#存储与同步模型","content":"嵌套对象和数组转换为 `Y.Map` 与 `Y.Array`；"},"393":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#存储与同步模型","content":"本地状态更新后，与上次同步的快照比较，将变化写入 Yjs。"},"394":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#存储与同步模型","content":"收到远端 Yjs 更新后，将相应变更应用到 Coaction store。"},"395":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-13","page_id":"/zh/d