"content":"`@coaction/zustand` whole-store adapter"},"433":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand#5-分别替换-middleware","content":"自定义外部 runtime"},"434":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand#5-分别替换-middleware","content":"`coaction/adapter` 的 `defineExternalStoreAdapter()`"},"435":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand#5-分别替换-middleware","content":"Coaction 目前未内置 Redux DevTools 集成。迁移后如需观察状态更新，可使用 logger 或项目已有的诊断工具。"},"436":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand#6-更安全时保留底层-zustand","content":"当已有 Zustand store 本身是 public API、其他模块直接依赖它，或替换所有权带来的风险大于收益时，使用 `@coaction/zustand`。该 adapter 绑定 whole store，不能嵌套进原生 Coaction slices。"},"437":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand#7-最后再加共享模式","content":"本地测试通过后，在 Worker 权威端创建同一 source 并连接 client。此时把 `create` 导入改为 shared 入口；默认 React 入口会拒绝 worker 选项："},"438":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand#7-最后再加共享模式","content":"按严格 JSON contract 审计状态，并将调用点改为 await action。Client 直接 `setState()` 不是受支持的迁移捷径。"},"439":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand#checklist","content":"第一轮保持显式 selector，只迁移行为；"},"440":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand#checklist","content":"把写入移入 `set()`，保持根 schema 稳定；"},"441":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand#checklist","content":"有选择地将重复派生 selector 改为缓存 getter；"},"442":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand#checklist","content":"只有 namespace 改善所有权时才选择 slices；"},"443":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand#checklist","content":"逐一替换 persist/history/logger；"},"444":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand#checklist","content":"合适时通过 adapter 保留原 Zustand runtime；"},"445":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/from-zustand#checklist","content":"本地行为与序列化验证后再引入 Worker。"},"446":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","type":"page","content":"迁移到 4.0","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4"},"447":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","content":"更新 shared 导入，检查集成 contract，让本地 React 应用使用受支持的版本，并检查 4.1 中 Mutative 2 带来的变化和 4.2 中数组元素的变化。"},"448":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"选择对应入口"},"449":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查底层写入与-middleware","content":"检查底层写入与 middleware"},"450":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-react-和-computed-假设","content":"检查 React 和 computed 假设"},"451":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查远程同步","content":"检查远程同步"},"452":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-41-中的-mutative-2","content":"检查 4.1 中的 Mutative 2"},"453":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-42-中的数组元素与-getinitialstate","content":"检查 4.2 中的数组元素与 `getInitialState()`"},"454":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","content":"使用 action、selector 和 getter 的原生本地应用通常可以保留现有 API。请使用 React 18 或 19，\n并检查所有跨 JavaScript 上下文共享状态的导入。\n仓库迁移指南包含更完整的 adapter 和本地图结构 contract。"},"455":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"用途"},"456":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"4.0 导入"},"457":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"Vanilla 本地 store"},"458":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"`coaction`"},"459":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"Vanilla 共享权威端或 client"},"460":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"`coaction/shared`"},"461":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"React 本地 store"},"462":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"`@coaction/react`"},"463":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"React 共享权威端或 client"},"464":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"`@coaction/react/shared`"},"465":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"集成与 commit hooks"},"466":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"`coaction/adapter`"},"467":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"可管理生命周期的派生 selector 和路径"},"468":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"`coaction/derived`"},"469":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"旧的 `coaction/local` 和 `@coaction/react/local` 别名已经移除。此前使用默认入口的共享 store 必须切换到 `/shared`："},"470":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"默认入口会拒绝非 null 的共享选项，例如 `worker`、`transport` 和 `clientTransport`。\n显式传入 undefined 的选项仍被接受，方便 feature detection 和 SSR。本地入口不会把共享 transport 运行时打进 bundle。"},"471":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查底层写入与-middleware","content":"`store.apply(nextState)` 和 `store.apply(base, patches)` 都会发布 commit。传入 patches 时，base 必须是当前状态：\n使用 `apply(undefined, patches)` 省略 base，或传入 `getPureState()`。错误的 base 会在修改状态和发布 commit 前被拒绝。"},"472":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查底层写入与-middleware","content":"Adapter 作者应保留 Coaction 对 `store.apply` 的所有权，通过 `internal.externalApply` 提供自身 runtime 的写入函数。\nMiddleware 应使用 StoreCommit hooks 观察所有受支持的 transition，包括不经过 `apply` 的写入。"},"473":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查底层写入与-middleware","content":"不要假设 patch pair 总是包含叶子路径。位置相关编辑可能回退到发生变化的 top-level key replacement；\n本地图结构可能需要 `path: []` 的完整 root snapshot。Replay 必须保留已经提交的值和引用拓扑。\n本地循环引用可以作为完整值用于初始化或 replacement；从 draft 引用构造循环、编辑循环 draft 内部仍不属于受支持的 recipe contract。\n这些本地保证不会扩展共享 JSON contract。"},"474":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-react-和-computed-假设","content":"React 18 和 19 受到支持并经过测试，React 17 已不在 peer range 中。\n服务端 selector 读取当前状态，与 whole-state 和 observer reader 一致。确实需要初始状态时，请显式使用 `getInitialState()`。\nSSR 应使用请求独立的 store，并准备一致的服务端与客户端 hydration 数据。"},"475":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-react-和-computed-假设","content":"原生 getter 仍以 store/slice 字段为依赖边界。React selector 和 `observer` 使用深层路径追踪；\n`derive(..., { deep: true })` 为可管理生命周期的 computed selector 显式开启深层追踪。\nIdentity、生命周期和失效边界详见 computed state。"},"476":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查远程同步","content":"`@coaction/sync` 要求状态可用 JSON 无损表示，无法表示的本地写入会在提交前被拒绝。默认配置还要求持久化存储。若允许进程退出时丢失待发送变更，可显式设置 `storage: false`。\nCheckpoint 包含 `formatVersion`；不受支持的版本和格式错误的 checkpoint 会被拒绝，并保留原有存储内容。\n没有版本字段的旧 checkpoint 按 format 1 读取。"},"477":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查远程同步","content":"升级 CRUD、Supabase 或 Firestore 集成时，请检查对应 README：CRUD adapter 保留远程 base，\nSupabase 的 schema 配置同时应用于读写，Firestore 分离读取来源与写入地址。\n配置和错误处理见远程同步。"},"478":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查远程同步","content":"响应式追踪、共享权威和远程同步是独立能力。本地 store 不需要 Worker 也能与服务器同步；\n共享 mirror 跟随同一个权威端，并不是可以独立分叉再合并的远程副本。"},"479":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-41-中的-mutative-2","content":"Coaction 4.1 依赖 Mutative 2，`@coaction/history`\n依赖以 Mutative 2 为 peer 的 Travels 3。Coaction 的 API 没有变化。\n如果应用直接导入 `mutative`，请一并升级到 2.0；以 Mutative 1 为 peer 的库（例如 `zustand-mutative` 1）\n需要替换为支持 Mutative 2 的版本，否则 npm 会在安装 `@coaction/history` 时以 `ERESOLVE` 停止。"},"480":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-41-中的-mutative-2","content":"Commit 中的 patch 遵循 Mutative 2：嵌套值的 patch 排在父级之前，被移动的 draft 由父级的 patch 携带。\n它们 replay 后得到相同的状态，因此只有比较 patch 数组的测试需要更新预期。生产构建中 Mutative 抛出的错误为\n`Minified Mutative error #<code>`，请匹配错误码，并在每个 bundle 中定义 `process.env.NODE_ENV`。\n无 bundler 加载方式和开发构建新增的 draft 检查，见仓库指南。"},"481":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-42-中的数组元素与-getinitialstate","content":"Coaction 4.2 从公开状态按索引读取数组中的普通对象时，会返回冻结后的元素本身。读取 `todos[0].title` 的 `observer()` 依赖 `todos[0]` 的引用。即使 `title` 未变，更新该元素的其他字段也会替换其引用，从而触发组件渲染。"},"482":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-42-中的数组元素与-getinitialstate","content":"`filter`、`find`、`at` 等只读数组方法按整个数组登记依赖，即使只读取了部分元素。若组件仅依赖某个字段或扫描结果，可用选择器返回所需值。依赖变化时选择器重新求值，只有结果变化才会触发组件渲染。通过对象键读取嵌套对象时，仍按原有路径追踪。"},"483":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-42-中的数组元素与-getinitialstate","content":"在 `set()` 之外写入元素时，严格模式代码会抛出引擎的 `TypeError`，非严格模式脚本则静默忽略这次写入，\n不再抛出 Coaction 的直接修改错误。`getInitialState()` 返回初始状态的副本，结构与工厂返回的对象相同，\n每次调用返回同一个对象，而不再是工厂返回的对象本身。`@coaction/react` 新增可选的 whole selector：\n`useStore(selector, { whole: true })` 将 store 持有的原始数据传给选择器。该接口不会创建防写代理，调用方须按只读数据使用。\n`create()` 和 `setState({ ... })` 仅保留数组元素。数组上的命名属性和 symbol 属性会被忽略，开发环境会给出一次警告。通过草稿更新数组同样不会保留这些属性。需要保存的元数据可放在与数组并列的对象字段中。\n仓库指南逐项对比了与 4.1 的差别。"},"484":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","type":"page","content":"性能与 bundle 边界","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance"},"485":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","content":"根据版本、数据规模和读写模式解读基准结果，并检查应用使用的包入口。"},"486":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#选择-local-入口","content":"选择 local 入口"},"487":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"运行维护的检查"},"488":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#派生状态的读取与更新成本","content":"派生状态的读取与更新成本"},"489":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#渲染性能","content":"渲染性能"},"490":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#性能检查清单","content":"性能检查清单"},"491":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","content":"比较吞吐量时，应注明运行环境、包版本、状态规模和操作顺序。仓库提供基准脚本，可用相同的工作负载复现结果。"},"492":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#选择-local-入口","content":"Vanilla 本地 store 应写为："},"493":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#选择-local-入口","content":"该静态边界排除共享 protocol、epoch、重连与 transport module。共享运行时使用 `coaction/shared`，React 中使用 `@coaction/react/shared`；默认 `@coaction/react` 入口也只包含 local 运行时。"},"494":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#选择-local-入口","content":"仓库的 bundle budget 测量发布入口与 tree-shaken consumer fixture。它们是回归门禁，不代表应用 bundle 必然等于预算数字；最终结果还取决于应用 bundler 保留的外部依赖。"},"495":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"`package:size` 检查发布入口预算与 core entry 隔离；"},"496":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"`benchmark` 对比大型 update path，包括 Coaction draft 与 Zustand + Immer；"},"497":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"`benchmark:zustand-positioning` 分离 stable derived read 与 update-then-read；"},"498":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"`benchmark:check` 校验绝对吞吐量下限和相对性能比值。CI 的 Ubuntu ARM 运行器对路径 effect 和 1,000 个元素各有一个读取者的写入测试使用单独标定的吞吐量下限。"},"499":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"`benchmark:derived` 在独立进程中使用构建后的入口，覆盖稀疏路径、相关／无关写入、全量扫描、缓存读取，以及尚未读取／已销毁的 owner。它已加入 `benchmark:check`；全量 deep scan 的结果用于展示追踪成本，原生 getter 提供 coarse scan 基线。"},"500":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"调整回归阈值时，应记录并评审运行时行为或测量方法的变化，以及支持调整的测量结果。"},"501":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#派生状态的读取与更新成本","content":"依赖未变化时，访问器直接返回缓存结果。更新后首次读取派生值时，Coaction 还需维护公开状态的只读视图，并刷新计算使用的快照。两种工作负载应分别计时。"},"502":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#派生状态的读取与更新成本","content":"原生本地 store 可直接比较写入前后已追踪的路径，即使依赖集合较大也能使用这种方式。提交钩子、补丁中间件和计算快照缓存等会请求补丁。普通 `subscribe()` 订阅本身不请求补丁。需要为其他用途生成补丁时，可显式设置 `enablePatches`。"},"503":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#派生状态的读取与更新成本","content":"比较派生读取时应注明总值的计算方式。Zustand 可以把预先计算的总值保存在字段中，应用负责在相关写入时同步更新该字段。Coaction 的 getter 由运行时维护缓存。单项测试结果只适用于对应的工作负载。"},"504":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#渲染性能","content":"原生 immutable store 上的 `useStore(selector)` 与 `observer()` 都使用可回收的深层路径追踪。读取 `state.user.name` 的 reader 可以在仅更新 age 的 recipe 后继续使用缓存。Selector 仍以 `Object.is` 比较结果；`observer()` 直接收集 render 中的读取，不需要额外 selector。请分别测量 selector 执行次数与组件 render 次数。"},"505":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#渲染性能","content":"数组元素是值：reader 依赖它读取的每个元素的身份，`filter`、`map` 等数组方法只对整个数组登记一个依赖。渲染 `todos[0].title` 的 `observer()` 会在 `todos[0]` 内部的任何写入后重新渲染，渲染扫描结果的 `observer()` 会在任一元素被写入后重新渲染。返回该字段或扫描结果的 selector 会重跑，但只有结果变化时才重新渲染。"},"506":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#渲染性能","content":"原生 getter 与 `get(deps, fn)` 仍以 store/slice 字段为边界。读取 `this.user.name` 的 getter 可能因 `user.age` 变化而重算，即使结果相同、消费者没有额外工作。需要更细依赖的派生读取可使用 `derive(..., { deep: true })` 或 `derivePath`。"},"507":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#渲染性能","content":"父对象 replacement、数组结构变化和 graph snapshot patches 可能扩大失效范围；外部 adapter 遵守各自的更新和快照 contract。具体边界见 computed 追踪粒度。"},"508":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#性能检查清单","content":"Vanilla 本地状态导入 `coaction`；"},"509":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#性能检查清单","content":"非必要时不设置 `enablePatches`，同时考虑会自动请求 patches 的消费者；"},"510":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#性能检查清单","content":"缓存 getter 用于重复派生读取，不承载副作用；"},"511":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#性能检查清单","content":"在确实减少 selector 组合时使用 `observer()`；"},"512":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#性能检查清单","content":"若 `observer()` 会因元素中其他字段的写入而重新渲染，改用 selector 读取数组元素的字段或扫描结果；"},"513":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#性能检查清单","content":"使用生产构建，在有代表性的数据规模和读写模式下进行性能分析。"},"514":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#性能检查清单","content":"用基准阈值检测回归。对外报告性能数据前，应在目标硬件上重新测量。"},"515":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"page","content":"Coaction 的适用场景与限制","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use"},"516":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","content":"从状态结构、跨线程共享、调用延迟和性能预算评估 Coaction 是否适合项目。"},"517":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#使用前需要评估的约束","content":"使用前需要评估的约束"},"518":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#只有普通的单标签页状态","content":"只有普通的单标签页状态"},"519":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#共享状态不是-json-形状","content":"共享状态不是 JSON 形状"},"520":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#调用方需要同步取得-action-的结果","content":"调用方需要同步取得 action 的结果"},"521":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#实测的更新热路径达不到性能预算","content":"实测的更新热路径达不到性能预算"},"522":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#项目依赖特定工具或中间件","content":"项目依赖特定工具或中间件"},"523":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#目标浏览器可能不支持-sharedworker","content":"目标浏览器可能不支持 SharedWorker"},"524":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#应该选择-coaction-的情况","content":"应该选择 Coaction 的情况"},"525":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#如何做出选择","content":"如何做出选择"},"526":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","content":"先确定状态由谁写入、哪些组件需要订阅、是否跨线程共享，再评估关键操作的延迟和吞吐量。单个组件内使用的状态通常可由组件本身管理。"},"527":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#只有普通的单标签页状态","content":"一个表单、一个计数器、一个设置面板。Coaction 的只读状态和响应式运行时成本可能超过这些需求的收益。\n默认 `coaction` 与 `@coaction/react` 入口排除了共享 transport 运行时；本地 store 不会把未启用的 transport 打进 bundle。\n如果更小的模型已经足够，**考虑 Zustand、Jotai 或组件本地状态**。当共享派生或读取追踪能减少大量应用代码时，\nCoaction 的 local 运行时就可能有价值，即使应用始终不需要 Worker。"},"528":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#共享状态不是-json-形状","content":"跨共享边界的一切——状态、动作参数、返回值——必须是纯 JSON 树：没有 `Date`、没有 `Map`、\n没有类实例、没有 `undefined`、没有循环引用。用富对象构建的领域模型要先做一次序列化重设计\n才能共享，而这个重设计才是真正的成本，不是那一次 store 调用。这类状态请保持 local，或者\n接受一层映射。具体规则见 JSON contract。"},"529":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#调用方需要同步取得-action-的结果","content":"页面可以同步读取本地镜像中的状态。通过镜像调用 action 时，方法在主存储端执行，结果通过 Promise 返回。如果调用方必须立即取得执行结果，或一次跨线程往返就会超出延迟预算，应让该 action 在本地执行。"},"530":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#实测的更新热路径达不到性能预算","content":"不要从一个微基准推导出普遍的写入惩罚。在这次 4.0 测量中，每次更新一个元素后都会读取一个遍历 1,000 项的\n派生总值；Coaction 的吞吐量约为对应 Zustand selector 场景的 55%，与手工维护派生字段的方案差距更大。\n另一项批量基准则表明，其他更新形状可能接近持平，也可能让 Mutative 占优。对于高频拖拽、动画帧和实时数据流\n的 tick 处理，请测量有代表性的实际操作；如果达不到所需预算，再跳过 Coaction。"},"531":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#项目依赖特定工具或中间件","content":"列出项目所需的开发工具、中间件及框架版本，对照支持矩阵核实哪些组合已有测试和维护承诺。对未列出的集成，应单独验证兼容性。"},"532":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#目标浏览器可能不支持-sharedworker","content":"部署前应在目标浏览器及其隐私模式下验证模块化 `SharedWorker`。若所有标签页必须共用同一可写状态实例，检测到接口缺失或构造失败时应终止初始化并报告错误。本地降级模式会让各标签页独立持有状态。"},"533":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#目标浏览器可能不支持-sharedworker","content":"若只要求最终一致，可评估通过 `BroadcastChannel` 传递更新并持久化状态的方案。此时应用须自行处理更新顺序和冲突。"},"534":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#应该选择-coaction-的情况","content":"**一份状态，多个标签页。** SharedWorker 权威 + 镜像客户端——跨标签页 todos\ndemo\n在三个引擎上完整回放跨标签页编辑会话。"},"535":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#应该选择-coaction-的情况","content":"**重计算移出主线程。** 把写权威放进 Web Worker，主线程从 mirror 同步读取。"},"536":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#应该选择-coaction-的情况","content":"**保留 `create()` 风格的状态定义。** 在组件中按读取路径追踪依赖，在 store 中通过 getter 缓存派生结果。"},"537":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#应该选择-coaction-的情况","content":"**渐进迁移现有 store。** 先用 Zustand 适配器 接入现有 store。迁移到 Worker 时，检查跨线程数据是否符合共享 JSON 约束，并将需要 action 结果的调用改为 `await`。"},"538":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#应该选择-coaction-的情况","content":"**实时协作。** Yjs binding 把 CRDT 状态放进同一个 store 接口。"},"539":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#如何做出选择","content":"如果项目需要跨线程执行 action、在多个标签页间共享一个可写状态实例，或在多个组件间复用派生结果，可用实际数据验证这些功能。最终选型还应满足应用的包体积预算，以及关键读写操作的延迟和吞吐量要求。"},"540":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","type":"page","content":"共享 JSON contract","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","共享运行时"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract"},"541":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","content":"明确哪些值可以跨越 Coaction 的 Worker、标签页与 transport 边界。"},"542":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#支持的值","content":"支持的值"},"543":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"被拒绝的值"},"544":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#方法与-getter-不是数据","content":"方法与 getter 不是数据"},"545":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#显式建模常见值","content":"显式建模常见值"},"546":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#local-模式不同","content":"Local 模式不同"},"547":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","content":"共享模式中的每个跨边界值都会编码为 JSON。Coaction 在值进入 wire protocol 前进行校验，而不是依赖 `JSON.stringify()` 静默归一化。"},"548":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","content":"规则适用于："},"549":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","content":"初始共享状态与 full-sync snapshot；"},"550":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","content":"action 参数；"},"551":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","content":"非 void action 结果；"},"552":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","content":"patch value；"},"553":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","content":"transport operation 携带的 replacement state。"},"554":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#支持的值","content":"共享数据必须构成 JSON 树。可传输的值包括以下类型。"},"555":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#支持的值","content":"`null`、布尔值和字符串。"},"556":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#支持的值","content":"有限数值，负零（`-0`）除外。"},"557":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#支持的值","content":"没有空槽的数组，每个元素都须符合本节的约束。"},"558":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#支持的值","content":"普通对象，键须为安全的字符串，每个属性值都须符合本节的约束。"},"559":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"无法被 JSON 无损保留的值会被拒绝："},"560":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"类别"},"561":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"示例"},"562":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"缺失/非 JSON primitive"},"563":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"`undefined`、`BigInt`、symbol"},"564":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"非有限或被归一化的数字"},"565":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"`NaN`、`Infinity`、`-Infinity`、`-0`"},"566":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"数据中的运行时行为"},"567":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"function、accessor"},"568":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"非 plain platform object"},"569":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"`Date`、`URL`、`Map`、`Set`、typed array、DOM object"},"570":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"有歧义的 graph"},"571":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"循环引用、同一对象的重复引用"},"572":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"不符合约束的数组"},"573":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"稀疏数组或带有额外可枚举属性的数组"},"574":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"不安全 key/path"},"575":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"受保护 patch path 中的 `__proto__`、`prototype`、`constructor`"},"576":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#被拒绝的值","content":"即使 `JSON.stringify()` 会把重复引用复制为两个对象，Coaction 仍会拒绝。Tree 无法保留 object identity，接受 alias 会让 authority 与 client 的 graph 可观察地不同。"},"577":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#方法与-getter-不是数据","content":"Store 方法和 computed accessor 属于运行时行为。Coaction 提取 pure state 进行传输，然后在两端通过各自声明的 source 恢复方法与 getter。"},"578":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#方法与-getter-不是数据","content":"函数不能作为共享数据传输。需要远程调用的逻辑应在状态定义中声明为 action，由主存储端执行。"},"579":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#显式建模常见值","content":"在应用边界完成转换，并为其定义稳定的领域表示。"},"580":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#local-模式不同","content":"严格 JSON contract 只在状态跨越共享边界时适用。本地 store 可以保存更丰富的应用值，但仍遵守普通不可变状态模型。如果一个 store 未来可能进入 Worker，从一开始就保持 JSON shape 会让迁移更可预测。"},"581":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/json-contract#local-模式不同","content":"共享值未通过校验时，运行时会拒绝传输。日期等领域类型应先编码成符合约束的数据，例如用\nISO 字符串表示日期。"},"582":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/overview","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/overview","type":"page","content":"共享运行时概览","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","共享运行时"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/overview"},"583":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/overview-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/overview","content":"通过 Worker、SharedWorker 或自定义 transport 使用单一权威端和任意数量的本地镜像。"},"584":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/overview-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/sha