ocs/shared/overview-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/overview#共享模式下中间件的安装位置","content":"持久化、历史记录和 Yjs 中间件会写入或合并状态，应安装在主存储端。客户端镜像会拒绝这些中间件。logger 可安装在任一端。客户端记录代理调用和镜像更新，主存储端记录 action 的实际执行过程。"},"606":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/overview-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/overview#共享模式下中间件的安装位置","content":"参阅 Worker 与重连，了解多标签页、epoch 与在途 action 行为。"},"607":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","type":"page","content":"Worker、策略与重连","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","共享运行时"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect"},"608":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","content":"配置 Worker/SharedWorker client、限制权威 action，并安全处理 epoch 变化。"},"609":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#dedicated-worker","content":"Dedicated Worker"},"610":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#跨标签页-sharedworker","content":"跨标签页 SharedWorker"},"611":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#限制远程方法调用","content":"限制远程方法调用"},"612":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#epoch-与-sequence-恢复","content":"Epoch 与 sequence 恢复"},"613":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#等待-action-对镜像可见","content":"等待 action 对镜像可见"},"614":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#action-执行期间权威端变化","content":"Action 执行期间权威端变化"},"615":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#dedicated-worker","content":"Dedicated Worker 为一个页面提供独立的权威生命周期："},"616":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#dedicated-worker","content":"当 client 不再拥有连接时销毁 Coaction store；根据应用所有权模型决定何时终止 Worker。"},"617":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#跨标签页-sharedworker","content":"一个可复用模块可在页面 runtime 中创建 SharedWorker，并在 Worker runtime 内成为权威端："},"618":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#跨标签页-sharedworker","content":"每个标签页得到一个 client mirror，SharedWorker 拥有唯一状态实例。显式传入值为 `undefined` 的\n`worker` key 时，store 会降级为 local authority。其 `getState()` action 仍返回 Promise，state、\naction 参数与返回值也继续遵守 shared JSON contract，因此 await 后的调用点可以在两种模式间迁移。"},"619":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#跨标签页-sharedworker","content":"若所有标签页必须共用一个可写 store，检测到 SharedWorker 不可用时，应终止初始化并报告错误。允许降级时，各标签页分别创建本地 store，`share === false`，可以调用底层的 `setState()` 和 `apply()`。通过 `getState()` 调用 action 时仍返回 Promise，读取结果前应先 `await`。"},"620":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#跨标签页-sharedworker","content":"如果 `new SharedWorker(...)` 在调用 `create()` 之前就抛出异常，Coaction 无法捕获。只有当产品\n确实允许 local fallback 时，应用才应自行捕获构造失败并保留 `undefined`。已经存在但在初始化\n期间失败的 worker 或 transport 会显式报错，不会静默改变 authority model。"},"621":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#限制远程方法调用","content":"主存储端仅暴露在 store 中发现的方法路径。通过 `transportPolicy`，可以限制客户端可调用的方法、配置请求授权并控制错误响应。"},"622":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#限制远程方法调用","content":"`allowedActions` 是方法路径 allowlist；"},"623":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#限制远程方法调用","content":"`authorize` 接收已解码 JSON execute 或 full-sync request；"},"624":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#限制远程方法调用","content":"`mapError` 可以返回刻意向 client 公开的消息。"},"625":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#限制远程方法调用","content":"未预期的 action error 会被脱敏为 `Remote action failed`，原始错误留在权威端。Policy code 是可信应用代码，应尽量保持无副作用。"},"626":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#epoch-与-sequence-恢复","content":"每个权威生命周期拥有唯一 epoch，sequence 从 0 开始。client 会："},"627":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#epoch-与-sequence-恢复","content":"获取原子 `{ epoch, sequence, state }` 