"page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"`subscribe(listener)`"},"722":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"订阅并返回 unsubscribe function"},"723":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"`apply(state?, patches?)`"},"724":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"底层集成/transport 更新；client 拒绝"},"725":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"`destroy()`"},"726":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"幂等清理订阅、集成与 transport"},"727":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"应用代码应优先使用具名 action，而不是 `apply()`；后者是 transport、middleware 与 adapter 的底层 contract。"},"728":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"`store.apply(nextState)` 和 `store.apply(base, patches)` 都会发布状态提交，`onStoreCommit` 及基于它的集成均可观察到这次更新。"},"729":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"传入补丁时，`base` 必须是 store 当前的状态。可传入 `store.getPureState()`，也可调用 `store.apply(undefined, patches)` 使用当前状态。基准状态不匹配时，运行时会在修改状态和发布提交前拒绝此次调用。"},"730":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#computed-声明","content":"无参数调用 `get()` 读取当前根状态。"},"731":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-63","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#生命周期-helper","content":"`onStoreReady(store, callback)` 将工作延迟到状态与集成完整 materialize 之后。callback 可返回在 `destroy()` 时运行的 cleanup。"},"732":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-64","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#生命周期-helper","content":"`wrapStore(store)` 提供给需要 callable store shape 的框架与集成作者。"},"733":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-65","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#signal-primitives","content":"`coaction` 与 `coaction/shared` re-export 高级 `alien-signals` primitive，包括 `signal`、`computed`、`effect`、`effectScope`、batch helper 与 type guard。普通应用派生状态仍应使用 getter 或 `get(deps, selector)`。"},"734":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#adapter-入口","content":"`coaction/adapter` 暴露 `defineExternalStoreAdapter()`（兼容别名 `createBinder()`）、mutable-adapter snapshot helper、根替换 helper、schema error 与 patch path safety utility。它面向集成作者，不用于普通状态更新。"},"735":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#adapter-入口","content":"该入口也导出 `onStoreCommit`、`onStoreCommitValidate`、`onStoreCommitPrepare` 和 `replayStorePatches`。\nHook 时机、验证、replay 和生命周期见 Store commits。"},"736":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-68","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#adapter-入口","content":"逐 symbol 生成的 TypeDoc 见仓库 API 目录。"},"737":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"page","content":"常见问题","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq"},"738":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","content":"直接回答本地使用、selector、序列化、schema、Worker、adapter 与 DevTools 问题。"},"739":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#不使用-worker-可以用-coaction-吗","content":"不使用 Worker 可以用 Coaction 吗？"},"740":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#react-中必须使用-observer-吗","content":"React 中必须使用 `observer()` 吗？"},"741":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#getter-每次读取都会重新计算吗","content":"Getter 每次读取都会重新计算吗？"},"742":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#为什么直接-mutation-会抛错","content":"为什么直接 mutation 会抛错？"},"743":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#可以稍后添加状态-key-吗","content":"可以稍后添加状态 key 吗？"},"744":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#为什么-client-action-返回-promise","content":"为什么 client action 返回 Promise？"},"745":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#为什么-jsonstringify-可用的值仍被共享模式拒绝","content":"为什么 `JSON.stringify()` 可用的值仍被共享模式拒绝？"},"746":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#本地状态可以包含循环引用和共享引用吗","content":"本地状态可以包含循环引用和共享引用吗？"},"747":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#可以在-shared-client-上-persist-或-undo-吗","content":"可以在 shared client 上 persist 或 undo 吗？"},"748":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#adapter-可以作为一个-slice-吗","content":"Adapter 可以作为一个 slice 吗？"},"749":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#coaction-包含-signal-primitive-吗","content":"Coaction 包含 signal primitive 吗？"},"750":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#coaction-有-redux-devtools-集成吗","content":"Coaction 有 Redux DevTools 集成吗？"},"751":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#什么时候应该选择-zustand","content":"什么时候应该选择 Zustand？"},"752":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#不使用-worker-可以用-coaction-吗","content":"可以。本地模式是建议起点，提供完整原生状态、action、computed、slices 与框架体验。Vanilla 本地应用应导入 `coaction`。"},"753":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#react-中必须使用-observer-吗","content":"不必。不使用 `observer()` 时，`useStore()` 订阅整个 store。也可以调用 `useStore(selector)`，或使用 `useStore.auto()` 返回的缓存 map。"},"754":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#react-中必须使用-observer-吗","content":"`observer()` 自动收集组件渲染期间的读取依赖，默认选择器则收集选择器执行期间的依赖。两者都能追踪嵌套对象的属性。通过索引读取数组中的对象时，依赖的是该元素的引用。"},"755":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#getter-每次读取都会重新计算吗","content":"不会。原生访问器 getter 通过 signal runtime 缓存，并在依赖变化时失效。请保持 getter 纯净。"},"756":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#为什么直接-mutation-会抛错","content":"Coaction public state 不可变。请在 `set()` 内写入，让运行时能够提交状态、使 computed 失效、通知 subscriber，并在需要时生成 patch。"},"757":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#可以稍后添加状态-key-吗","content":"不能添加到 public 根。Coaction 初始化后固定根 schema；请预先声明 record 或 array field，再向其中增加动态 entry。"},"758":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#为什么-client-action-返回-promise","content":"共享 client 不在本地执行方法。它将方法路径和参数发送给 authority，等待结果，再等待镜像到达权威端报告的 sequence。"},"759":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#为什么-jsonstringify-可用的值仍被共享模式拒绝","content":"`JSON.stringify()` 会静默归一化或丢弃某些值。Coaction 要求无损 JSON tree，因此拒绝 `undefined`、非有限数、`-0`、accessor、platform object、sparse array、cycle 与重复引用。"},"760":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#本地状态可以包含循环引用和共享引用吗","content":"可以，初始化和完整值替换会保留这些引用关系。原生 recipe 仍然使用 Mutative draft，\n不支持用 draft 引用创建循环，也不支持进入循环结构内部进行 draft 编辑。\n应先用普通对象构造完整的新值，再替换对应字段："},"761":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#本地状态可以包含循环引用和共享引用吗","content":"也可以在 recipe 内把这个完整值赋给字段。如果循环包含根节点，使用 `store.apply(nextState)`\n替换整个状态。传入 store 后，不要继续修改这个值。"},"762":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#本地状态可以包含循环引用和共享引用吗","content":"无环的共享节点按路径生成独立 draft，因此修改 `draft.left.value` 不一定修改\n`draft.right.value`。如果结果需要共享同一个节点，应显式赋值 `draft.right = draft.left`。"},"763":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#本地状态可以包含循环引用和共享引用吗","content":"Commit 重放和 history 会保留记录结果的引用关系，必要时使用快照。它们不会扩大 draft\n编辑的支持范围，共享传输仍然要求 JSON 树。"},"764":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#可以在-shared-client-上-persist-或-undo-吗","content":"不能。Persist 与 history 是权威端集成。client-local 写入会创造第二个 authority，并与其他镜像分叉。"},"765":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#adapter-可以作为一个-slice-吗","content":"不能。Zustand、MobX、Pinia、Jotai、Redux、Valtio 与 XState 集成都是 whole-store adapter。一个 store 应在原生 Coaction slices 与外部 adapter 之间选择。"},"766":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#coaction-包含-signal-primitive-吗","content":"包含，advanced `alien-signals` primitive 会被 re-export。普通应用派生状态仍应使用 getter 或 `get(deps, selector)`。"},"767":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#coaction-有-redux-devtools-集成吗","content":"Coaction 目前未内置 Redux DevTools 集成。可使用 logger 或项目已有的调试工具观察状态更新。"},"768":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#什么时候应该选择-zustand","content":"当最重要的是极小 hook store、显式 selector、最小 bundle 和生态成熟度时，选择 Zustand。当自动渲染追踪、维护式缓存派生、自然 `this` action，或未来共享运行时能显著降低应用复杂度时，选择 Coaction。"},"769":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","type":"page","content":"Store commits","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits"},"770":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","content":"通过 Coaction 的集成 contract 观察 transition、验证写入并 replay patch pair。"},"771":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"Commit 结构"},"772":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"Hook 时机与生命周期"},"773":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#通过-store-replay","content":"通过 store replay"},"774":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","content":"Commit hooks 面向 history、持久化、同步等集成。应用代码通常通过命名 action 写入，通过框架订阅读取。\n这些 hooks 从 `coaction/adapter` 导入，也适用于由默认 local 入口创建的 store。"},"775":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"`StoreCommit<T>` 包含该 transition 产生的状态和描述变化的 patch pair："},"776":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"字段"},"777":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"含义"},"778":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"`state`"},"779":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"Transition 产生的状态，请作为只读值使用"},"780":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"`patches`"},"781":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"从前一状态到当前状态的正向变