s/reference/store-commits-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"Commit listener 先于普通 subscription 和 effect 执行。重入写入会先完成前一个 commit 的交付，再次修改状态。\nObserver 抛出的错误会在 commit 和 subscription 交付后返回调用者，不会回滚已经接受的 transition。"},"801":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"Validator 不得写入 store。抛错会在 Coaction 管理的 transition 修改状态前将其拒绝。\n直接修改外部 mutable instance 的行为，在 Coaction 观察到时已经发生，因此不能由 validator 撤销。\nPrepare listener 是处理对象图的集成 hook，不是通用的验证 hook。"},"802":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#通过-store-replay","content":"Replay 基于当前状态和完整 patch pair，经过验证、patch middleware、adapter writer 和通知链路，\n不能绕过 client mirror 的写入限制。History 应按正确顺序 replay，并避免把自身 undo 记录为新的用户编辑。\n可选的 `setState` 配置用于传入 middleware 作用域内的写入入口，使集成 wrapper 也能观察到 replay。"},"803":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#通过-store-replay","content":"`apply` 所有权和图结构边界见 4.0 迁移；\n完整函数签名见 TypeDoc 生成的 API 参考。"},"804":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","type":"page","content":"支持矩阵","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix"},"805":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","content":"原生 store、外部 adapter、middleware 与 Yjs 的维护组合。"},"806":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix#原生-store","content":"原生 store"},"807":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-2","